    {
      "content": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n1024✨G3陀螺官方賽✨<br />\n<br />\n兩個月一期的G3的官方賽<br />\n最後一場在今天結束囉~<br />\n感謝所有來賓的參與<br />\n也恭喜這幾次前三名拿到限定零件的朋友唷😊<br />\n<br />\n11....",
      "full_text": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n1024✨G3陀螺官方賽✨<br />\n<br />\n兩個月一期的G3的官方賽<br />\n最後一場在今天結束囉~<br />\n感謝所有來賓的參與<br />\n也恭喜這幾次前三名拿到限定零件的朋友唷😊<br />\n<br />\n11.12月如果還有安排G3賽事<br />\n一樣會在海電電FB粉絲團公告<br />\n請大家持續鎖定唷👍<br />\n<br />\n#戰鬥陀螺 #官方賽 #台南 #海佃 #湯姆熊<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://scontent-ams4-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/861525438_1562568199224784_4573749370854393874_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=yeSh29o1KzUQ7kNvwHyxevX&amp;_nc_oc=AdpOlM_g5A3UiDE9Vqvb6AIQXmii-pkQOEUv8N3ptg1tVIXrgSZJ_o2bEWwheMyN9bE&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-ams4-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=jdloRHvzwqPd8j0yUBR7sA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJud7mFxQOrLrZHd_7_TjcjNCVxz8ZV6VK7B2kgKIZGAiLoOB2Q8LEOdA6husX5lVnuG2Qyk39P&amp;oh=00_AQTtrJen7tddUVjSFeOWqXcMGrDfJlAPuVhEhjleJK4P_w&amp;oe=6AE9CCA4\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-ams4-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/862850795_1562568812558056_5073562579851793284_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=kn0oj0tT7-UQ7kNvwGjr36F&amp;_nc_oc=AdpmmNVXDnarOMeLd3ixVnlWbfQAhQENW-0FAC5Lnw96L3Rp-9cIq2vvetDgPNnXvcY&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-ams4-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=jdloRHvzwqPd8j0yUBR7sA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLeS5AQOmsMybeApQMY8WVMTLaLqJ9hrQ-c-Qtu184RMizbIUkt-lO1itGIYJE3np63htKPU-Zy&amp;oh=00_AQSc7RHWQdbCpk1A_CrDB5QuFXoWYTdqWpTVgOnu-MkCAQ&amp;oe=6AE9BD05\" width=\"720\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-ams4-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/861217877_1562568825891388_430941940602498468_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=-Dwb2e7p86QQ7kNvwFZLEeN&amp;_nc_oc=AdpbJ42GoBjHwj-G7bjZm6U-I12laGhFQ-No2jRgJZU705k1C6MNjPpdtBDyKA9iI64&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-ams4-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=jdloRHvzwqPd8j0yUBR7sA&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQIh1wnQfCl292HdiSstwAyX4IIsapPsRX1fSQ7VhHqhfS